<title>SWITZERLAND: ENI sees oil prices easing in coming month.</title>
<headline>ENI sees oil prices easing in coming month.</headline>
<dateline>DAVOS, Switzerland 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>International oil prices should ease around one or two dollars per barrel over the coming months, ENI SpA managing director Franco Bernabe said.</p>
<p>&quot;I think that they should ease slightly compared with current levels...in the next month or two they should ease one or two dollars to stand around 20 dollars per barrel,&quot; he told journalists at the World Economic Forum.</p>
</text>
